# Brambleguard Captain may target itself ("target creature you control"): with no other creature it is the only legal target, and
# X is its power, 2, so it becomes a 4/3 until end of turn (CR 611.2a). It attacks as a 4/3 and Bot2 goes from 20 to 16.

